        "body": "1. An item that adds a variant names the extension point it implements, the registry it is registered in and the composition root that passes that registry; no item adds a branch to existing code (`src/dw/README.md` says where each change goes).\n2. An item's acceptance names the test that fails first — its file and the behaviour it asserts — and the gates to run.\n3. No item edits `src/testing/fixtures/`; a change of output (CLI output or a prompt) is an item that declares a divergence in `src/testing/dw-divergences.ts`.\n4. An item that changes templates has `bin/dw validate` in its acceptance.",
